{"3816640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SAS: Heks", "steam_appid": 3816640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You bought a second-hand laptop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The previous owner is still using it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SAS // HEKS is a first-person desktop horror experience where you explore the files, messages, and systems left behind by Martin Voss. At first, it looks like an ordinary life — emails, photos, work software. Then things stop lining up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Messages are sent at times you don’t remember.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People saw Martin where he couldn’t have been.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Files change. Records disagree.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is following a pattern — and you are now part of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/9c5644b2e17c42727d69261f8f1ca327.avif?t=1777064138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras_big/9c5644b2e17c42727d69261f8f1ca327.webp?t=1777064138 width=1560 height=799 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate Martin’s digital life through a simulated operating system. Open emails, browse archived data, inspect images, and uncover hidden files. Every interaction reveals more about what happened — and what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/2195c27b3cef0d6817ec3e607630782b.avif?t=1777064138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras_big/2195c27b3cef0d6817ec3e607630782b.webp?t=1777064138 width=1560 height=796 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the world shifts. Personal messages become warnings. Ordinary files become evidence. The system begins to respond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A parallel trail emerges through fragmented folklore, anonymous forums, and institutional records. Different people, different languages — all describing the same intrusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/af1d29cb3792cd280ab173b977206d76.avif?t=1777064138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras_big/af1d29cb3792cd280ab173b977206d76.webp?t=1777064138 width=1560 height=798 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A fully interactive desktop simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Psychological horror driven by subtle, realistic anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple paths and endings based on your discoveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Layered narrative across personal, paranormal, and scientific perspectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No jumpscares — tension builds through observation and realization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not uncovering a mystery.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are continuing it.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You bought a second-hand laptop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The previous owner is still using it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SAS // HEKS is a first-person desktop horror experience where you explore the files, messages, and systems left behind by Martin Voss. At first, it looks like an ordinary life — emails, photos, work software. Then things stop lining up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Messages are sent at times you don’t remember.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People saw Martin where he couldn’t have been.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Files change. Records disagree.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something is following a pattern — and you are now part of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/9c5644b2e17c42727d69261f8f1ca327.avif?t=1777064138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras_big/9c5644b2e17c42727d69261f8f1ca327.webp?t=1777064138 width=1560 height=799 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate Martin’s digital life through a simulated operating system. Open emails, browse archived data, inspect images, and uncover hidden files. Every interaction reveals more about what happened — and what is happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/2195c27b3cef0d6817ec3e607630782b.avif?t=1777064138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras_big/2195c27b3cef0d6817ec3e607630782b.webp?t=1777064138 width=1560 height=796 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more the world shifts. Personal messages become warnings. Ordinary files become evidence. The system begins to respond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A parallel trail emerges through fragmented folklore, anonymous forums, and institutional records. Different people, different languages — all describing the same intrusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras/af1d29cb3792cd280ab173b977206d76.avif?t=1777064138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/extras_big/af1d29cb3792cd280ab173b977206d76.webp?t=1777064138 width=1560 height=798 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A fully interactive desktop simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Psychological horror driven by subtle, realistic anomalies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple paths and endings based on your discoveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Layered narrative across personal, paranormal, and scientific perspectives</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No jumpscares — tension builds through observation and realization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not uncovering a mystery.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are continuing it.</p>", "short_description": "Investigate a second-hand laptop in this first-person psychological horror experience, uncovering files, messages, and anomalies that don’t match reality.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/96e9b8e5a62277c1814ddf9335ac0e660b5d55a5/header.jpg?t=1777064138", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/a64734bde954877c8babca7c40d2dad790ca4505/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777064138", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816640/a64734bde954877c8babca7c40d2dad790ca4505/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777064138", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7, 8, 10, 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</s